    "created_at": "2023-11-17T07:56:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-11-17T07:56:19Z",
    "body": "If we did want to refactor to not have any realm dependency, we could basically pull out steps 4-5 of https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-json.parse , and then crawl the ParseNode tree instead of our current strategy of crawling the object tree. I have a lot less experience working with ParseNodes in specs, but it's at least conceivable that this is about the same amount of work as [what we currently do](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#convert-a-json-derived-javascript-value-to-an-infra-value)?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
